00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:17.990
So if you like salad, go ahead.

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:21.755
But Joe wouldn't get this for sure.

00:07:21.755 --> 00:07:23.812
What, did Subway get a
panini press or something?

00:07:23.812 --> 00:07:25.150
Like, look at these. They
just took these sandwiches

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:26.450
and grilled them or whatever.

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:29.650
OK, this one right here is the BMT.

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:31.740
So, I'm just guessing for the melts,

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:33.060
they do it on the white bread,

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:33.920
and they add a bunch of cheese,

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:35.260
and they just grill it, right?

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:36.242
I mean, I can't even open this.

00:07:36.242 --> 00:07:37.920
Like, it's locked.

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:39.420
Buffalo chicken melt.

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:40.670
Maybe there's less vegetables in it,

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:42.520
so maybe I do want this
and I don't realize it.

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:44.180
Steak and cheese.

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:45.663
A Philly cheesesteak, right?

00:07:45.663 --> 00:07:47.012
Blech. I know this one.

00:07:47.012 --> 00:07:48.720
I know this one!

00:07:48.720 --> 00:07:50.730
Tuna melt.

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:52.271
Turkey melt. Yeah, I guess.

00:07:52.271 --> 00:07:53.360
I mean, I gotta say, like,

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:54.500
I haven't tasted them,

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:55.862
but the effort in these are just like,

00:07:55.862 --> 00:07:56.700
what are you guys doing?

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:59.670
I mean, they just, like, flattened them.

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:01.200
Ham melt.

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:02.403
What's SP again?

00:08:02.403 --> 00:08:03.820
Producer: Spicy Italian.

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:07.100
It should be SI, but
it's SP for spicy, right?

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:08.500
That's why I'm like, "Wait a second,

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.913
is this the spaghetti one
we've been talking about?"

00:08:10.913 --> 00:08:12.354
Meatball melt. What'd they do?

00:08:12.354 --> 00:08:14.473
They flattened the
meatballs in there, right?

00:08:14.473 --> 00:08:15.530
Oh, f---.

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:17.230
I mean, it's better.
Less vegetables, right?

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:19.603
This is the chicken bacon melt.

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:24.550
So, this is the Japan Only sandwich.

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:28.130
Everything on here, you
can't get in the US.

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:32.370
It's a 6-inch on sesame
bread with tandoori chicken,

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:36.720
