00:08:43.192 --> 00:08:44.276
Itadakimasu.

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:50.520
I said wasabi soy sauce, right?

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:52.920
I got wasabi attack.

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.716
It's hurting me.

00:08:54.716 --> 00:08:59.110
