00:09:33.623 --> 00:09:35.065
It kind of makes it a little sweeter.

00:09:35.065 --> 00:09:37.470
I'm gonna take another bite. Yeah!

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:39.500
Subway, put this on your menu.

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:40.760
This is really good.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:43.080
I challenge you, all the
viewers in the United States,

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.760
