00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:45.930
Let's put the pressure on Subway

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:48.010
to make this a featured sandwich.

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:49.201
This is good!

00:09:49.201 --> 00:09:50.034
Mm!

00:09:50.034 --> 00:09:53.160
So, here we've got snack sandwiches.

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:56.850
This one right here is anko sandwich.

00:09:56.850 --> 00:10:00.800
And anko is a staple of
traditional Japanese sweets.

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:05.030
The taste can be enjoyed
alone or as a complement

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:08.360
to other Japanese flavors, such as matcha.

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:10.360
And here we've got

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:13.540
