00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:31.330
I think this is the
steak, egg, and cheese.

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:33.115
Oh, it's flatbread too,
so I can kind of --

00:10:33.115 --> 00:10:34.460
[laughs]

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.400
