00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:37.683
Look at this!

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:40.930
Look at the eggs.

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:42.750
Are you kidding me with this?

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:43.810
At a Subway in the US,

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:45.570
