00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:52.830
So, you know my feelings on salad.

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:53.730
I hate them.

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:54.690
Just an example, though,

00:10:54.690 --> 00:10:56.800
