00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:02.770
Then once you're done you
can throw it in the ocean.

00:11:02.770 --> 00:11:04.173
Kill a sea turtle.

00:11:04.173 --> 00:11:05.413
Who cares? Why?

00:11:05.413 --> 00:11:06.890
It's a waste. It's an absolute waste.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.440
Just eat a sandwich like a normal person.

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:10.200
There's nothing wrong with bread.

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:11.860
Just eat it! It's a sandwich!

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:12.693
Yeah, God.

00:11:12.693 --> 00:11:13.860
And it's the shredded lettuce, too.

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:17.414
It's not, like, leafy lettuce
or spinach or anything.

00:11:17.414 --> 00:11:19.340
It's just that shredduce that
they put on the sandwich.

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:20.760
